== Important Notes ==
* These are '''base''' rates.
* Final outcomes are affected by:
* rod tier stats
* rod rarity bump chance
* active Fisher pet bonuses
* active event boosts (example: Fishing Madness)

== Seasonal Fish ==
Fish pool supports seasonal entries by month, while rarity logic remains in the same core system.

